{"suttaId":"thag2.37","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1020,1026],"vripara":"193"},"segments":{"thag2.37:0.4":"Soṇapoṭiriyattheragāthā","thag2.37:1.1":"“Na tāva supituṃ hoti, ratti nakkhattamālinī;","thag2.37:1.3":"Paṭijaggitumevesā, ratti hoti vijānatā.","thag2.37:2.1":"“Hatthikkhandhāvapatitaṃ, kuñjaro ce anukkame;","thag2.37:2.3":"Saṅgāme me mataṃ seyyo, yañce jīve parājito”ti.","thag2.37:2.5":"… Soṇo poṭiriyo [selissariyo (sī.), poṭṭiriyaputto (syā.)] thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
